  "rules": [
    "Define the selected palette as CSS variables on .paper-poster.",
    "Use the fixed identity-header treatment: white/near-white header with a single top accent rule only; no bottom header rule or side outline.",
    "Keep panel interiors, native table cells, and ordinary readouts white or neutral; source figure/table wrapper DOM boxes may exist for measurement but should use transparent borders with no visible outline or shadow.",
    "Do not use gradients, random per-section colors, default AI purple/indigo, colored body panels, heavy colored panel borders, or extra decorative colors.",
    "Keep source figures and source table crops in their original paper colors."
  ]
